  <Document>
    <name>Eruv Borders (Public)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[University City Eruv Borders--<br><br>This map is not designed to provide exact geographical Eruv borders, rather it is informational to the extent that it delineates where one can definitely carry. <br><br>Any street that overlaps with a border should be assumed to be outside the Eruv. <br>Streets that are entirely inside the border are in the Eruv, but if you do plan on carrying near the border please contact us to make sure you will be staying inside.<br><br>Penn Park should be entered over the Paley Bridge.<br><br>Regarding continuing East on South St. past the main eruv boundary: There is a connector to the Center City Eruv allowing carrying into Center City only via the South St. Bridge. The connector is supervised by the Center City Eruv Corporation.<br><br>Please contact us for any questions on exact boundaries.]]></description>
